      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// HARDCODE YOUR TECH STACK HERE\nconst myTechStack = \"Windows Server 2022, Python 3.9, Apache Tomcat, AWS EC2\";\n\nreturn items.map(item => {\n  const fields = item.json.fields || item.json;\n\n  // Pull richest available text - OTX has different field names than Krebs/NVD\n  const title = fields['title'] || fields['Title'] || 'Untitled';\n  const affectedSoftware = fields['Affected Software'] || '';\n  const malwareFamilies = fields['malware_families'] || '';\n  const adversary = fields['adversary'] || '';\n  const industries = fields['industries'] || '';\n  const tags = fields['tags'] || '';\n  const cveFids = fields['CVE IDs'] || '';\n\n  // Use AI Summary first, then plain Summary, then raw description\n  const threatText = fields['AI Summary'] || fields['Summary'] || fields['description'] || 'No description available.';\n\n  const prompt = `You are an expert cybersecurity analyst. Evaluate a threat intelligence pulse against this specific technology stack: ${myTechStack}\n\nThreat Title: ${title}\nMalware Families: ${malwareFamilies || 'Not specified'}\nAdversary: ${adversary || 'Not specified'}\nIndustries Targeted: ${industries || 'Not specified'}\nTags: ${tags || 'None'}\nCVE IDs: ${cveFids || 'None'}\nAffected Software: ${affectedSoftware || 'Not specified'}\nThreat Summary: ${threatText}\n\nEvaluate the overlap between this threat and the tech stack. Consider:\n- Does the malware or adversary target Windows Server, Python, Tomcat, or AWS environments?\n- Do the CVEs or affected software match anything in the stack?\n- Even indirect relevance (e.g. credential theft, supply chain) counts for partial scores.\n\nOutput strictly in JSON format with one key:\n- \"score\": A number from 0 to 100 representing how relevant this threat is to the tech stack. Use 0 only if there is truly zero relevance.\n\nDo not include any markdown formatting, backticks, or extra text. Just the JSON object.`;\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      recordId: item.json.id,\n      prompt: prompt\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
